 {:db/id "q-70743" :question/id #uuid "8e77e511-a545-50af-975e-802c98ad3a19" :question/math-academy-id "q-70743" :question/problem "Which of the following values is in the domain of $y=\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x?$" :question/worked-solution "Let's recall the graph of $y=\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x.$\n\n![](images/9d/9dcc5a116c2a564547283783a7df7b1cd3a9ab3b76ac24dc2695c4cb367796d5.png)\n\nNote that:\n\n- The domain of the function is $[-1,1].$\n\nTherefore, of the given values, only $x=\\frac{2}{3}$ is in the domain of $y=\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-70743/ma-source-field/75dd49a6dc092b51eb4c34c98c54dd42296b0cc9a63b0a5f76343594f8f652d7"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]}
