 {:db/id "q-80432/ma-source-field/7eb99bcfad6b8ef78af2e614e0a312ff1b623a38055f8d99c9923d3d8b0c258a" :answer-field/id #uuid "5326ac8e-fdd3-536f-93df-14753522f064" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["q-80432/ma-source-field/7eb99bcfad6b8ef78af2e614e0a312ff1b623a38055f8d99c9923d3d8b0c258a/3f6a4b4b41807b3ea9dc091422129c9fe3ba523fa3f921893ccc88f9bf626cda" "q-80432/ma-source-field/7eb99bcfad6b8ef78af2e614e0a312ff1b623a38055f8d99c9923d3d8b0c258a/226a27a43e12e92a24989a03295f59ba84db4a87bbb9ad19c0be1e5083816d82" "q-80432/ma-source-field/7eb99bcfad6b8ef78af2e614e0a312ff1b623a38055f8d99c9923d3d8b0c258a/c8c307d16ed71eecf4e0b8c8a8ed64f1a2c1d56dd1023f05db6d9f653bf403e3" "q-80432/ma-source-field/7eb99bcfad6b8ef78af2e614e0a312ff1b623a38055f8d99c9923d3d8b0c258a/1a4d40c8b50542e39179d453f3bc838916aafce8d778175c39c7926386c7be91" "q-80432/ma-source-field/7eb99bcfad6b8ef78af2e614e0a312ff1b623a38055f8d99c9923d3d8b0c258a/3d038e5f8cc673c45a5808666db769ca440923b7557f025ace2533055d25c7e2"] :answer-field/correct "q-80432/ma-source-field/7eb99bcfad6b8ef78af2e614e0a312ff1b623a38055f8d99c9923d3d8b0c258a/c8c307d16ed71eecf4e0b8c8a8ed64f1a2c1d56dd1023f05db6d9f653bf403e3" :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]}
 {:db/id "q-80432" :question/id #uuid "c61daa7e-9a16-5ba4-9cd7-641808843be0" :question/math-academy-id "q-80432" :question/problem "If $X={1,3,5,…,99}$, which collection of subsets of $X$ is a partition of $X?$" :question/worked-solution "A partition of a set $X$ is a collection of non-empty subsets of $X$ where every element of $X$ is contained in *exactly* one subset. \n\nOf the given collections, only ${{1,3,5,…,49},{51,53,55,…,99}}$ is a partition.\n\nThe rest of the collections are not partitions:\n\n- ${{1,3,5,…,99},{2,4,6,…,98}}$ is not a partition because it contains many even elements (such as $2$) that do not appear in $X.$\n\n- ${{1,3,5,…,49},{41,43,45,…,99}}$ is not a partition because many elements (such as $41$) appear in both subsets.\n\n- ${{1,3,5,…,69},{70,71,72,…,99}}$ is not a partition because it contains many even elements (such as $70$) that do not appear in $X.$\n\n- ${{1,3,5,…,39},{51,53,55,…,99}}$ is not a partition because many elements (such as $41$) do not appear in any subsets." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-80432/ma-source-field/7eb99bcfad6b8ef78af2e614e0a312ff1b623a38055f8d99c9923d3d8b0c258a"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]}
