 {:db/id "q-80460/ma-source-field/4a3be1ed6e6a7dc5f01b2d7a4a834e8bd76c0d00544a8c9316158c5a55f08ab5" :answer-field/id #uuid "5f4c5d2d-c5b6-5ecd-b722-b08fb64f2522" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["q-80460/ma-source-field/4a3be1ed6e6a7dc5f01b2d7a4a834e8bd76c0d00544a8c9316158c5a55f08ab5/a70c2c97dfddb48157f7e1bded34e55718b89a052d98a547e4479a8552a63481" "q-80460/ma-source-field/4a3be1ed6e6a7dc5f01b2d7a4a834e8bd76c0d00544a8c9316158c5a55f08ab5/a5569616a1ed02f767e74efaca2b6ca05ebd9bec5e4db46627973ee226ba3966" "q-80460/ma-source-field/4a3be1ed6e6a7dc5f01b2d7a4a834e8bd76c0d00544a8c9316158c5a55f08ab5/0cad4a030334d7f1695574676ada61aea86080da4e6b3ce16c3d6bfd5666691e" "q-80460/ma-source-field/4a3be1ed6e6a7dc5f01b2d7a4a834e8bd76c0d00544a8c9316158c5a55f08ab5/ead16664da44e06a050b99b3fc34a90cc0f51d118559061e712a585454111ff5" "q-80460/ma-source-field/4a3be1ed6e6a7dc5f01b2d7a4a834e8bd76c0d00544a8c9316158c5a55f08ab5/f5582f15e975ccce03a51c356a333639e3a997c8594964b32d7fec992da7e89a"] :answer-field/correct "q-80460/ma-source-field/4a3be1ed6e6a7dc5f01b2d7a4a834e8bd76c0d00544a8c9316158c5a55f08ab5/f5582f15e975ccce03a51c356a333639e3a997c8594964b32d7fec992da7e89a" :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]}
 {:db/id [:question/id #uuid "22f82dbd-7046-58bc-9a39-900370a35623"] :question/problem "If ${F}^{′}(t)=⟨3{t}^{2},\\,{e}^{t}⟩,$ then $F(t)=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we note that \n\n$$\nF(t)=\\int {F}^{′}(t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\int ⟨3{t}^{2},\\,{e}^{t}⟩\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nTo integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately. So, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨3{t}^{2},\\,{e}^{t}⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨\\int 3{t}^{2}\\,\\text{d}t,\\,\\int {e}^{t}\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{t}^{3}+{c}_{1},\\,{e}^{t}+{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{t}^{3},\\,{e}^{t}⟩+⟨{c}_{1},\\,{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{t}^{3},\\,{e}^{t}⟩+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C$ is an arbitrary (vector) constant of integration." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-80460/ma-source-field/4a3be1ed6e6a7dc5f01b2d7a4a834e8bd76c0d00544a8c9316158c5a55f08ab5"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]}
